WEBVTT

01:36.960 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:39.000 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:47.960 --> 01:50.280
ARBITER HALL

01:50.360 --> 01:51.480
Daqiang.

01:53.080 --> 01:54.080
Daqiang.

01:57.760 --> 01:58.640
Daqiang.

02:00.160 --> 02:01.320
Why are you so flustered?

02:02.040 --> 02:04.280
Do you know why I'm so happy?

02:05.000 --> 02:07.560
Lord Changheng praised me.

02:10.600 --> 02:12.320
Didn't you go there to cancel the result?

02:13.560 --> 02:15.400
Things have changed.

02:16.240 --> 02:18.200
Everyone said I deserved it

02:18.280 --> 02:20.800
and Lord Changheng praised me.

02:20.880 --> 02:24.920
He said I'm a role model
for all fairies of Shuiyuntian.

02:25.480 --> 02:27.240
He even gave me the Firefly Stone.

02:28.240 --> 02:30.600
What a coincidence.

02:30.680 --> 02:32.840
Why did the fireflies fly

02:32.920 --> 02:34.120
to my garden at Arbiter Hall

02:34.200 --> 02:35.440
and nibble my flowers?

02:36.400 --> 02:37.880
Does this mean

02:37.960 --> 02:41.040
I'm destined to be with Lord Changheng?

02:43.000 --> 02:45.320
You're unpredictable and unsteady.

03:12.560 --> 03:13.400
My lord,

03:14.720 --> 03:16.080
is there anything wrong?

03:17.400 --> 03:18.320
It's odd.

03:19.040 --> 03:22.280
The One Heart Curse should have let us
share our joy and sorrow.

03:22.960 --> 03:25.480
She was so excited

03:26.040 --> 03:27.800
about the praise from Changheng

03:27.880 --> 03:29.240
and the chance to serve him.

03:29.880 --> 03:30.800
But I

03:32.640 --> 03:33.680
felt uncomfortable.

03:34.680 --> 03:36.760
I didn't expect the spell of Xilan

03:36.840 --> 03:38.360
to be this odd.

03:39.880 --> 03:41.120
We can't be unguarded.

03:42.280 --> 03:43.160
But my lord,

03:44.400 --> 03:46.560
since Little Flower Spirit
has been in a good mood,

03:47.120 --> 03:48.320
she will soon regain her energy

03:49.000 --> 03:50.080
and fix the Destiny Book.

03:50.680 --> 03:51.640
There's no need to rush.

03:52.120 --> 03:53.600
Although she's getting better,

03:54.120 --> 03:55.800
she has only recovered 70%.

03:56.400 --> 03:58.720
Don't be anxious to fix the Destiny Book.

04:04.400 --> 04:05.320
Yes.

04:10.880 --> 04:12.320
Sweep all the fallen leaves.

04:13.000 --> 04:14.400
Put that flower pot there.

04:14.480 --> 04:15.360
Yes.

04:15.440 --> 04:17.519
What are you doing, Fairy Yulin?

04:17.600 --> 04:19.720
The recruiting list of Fountain Palace
hasn't been announced.

04:19.800 --> 04:22.440
Why are you sweeping the floor
and moving the flower pots here?

04:22.520 --> 04:24.200
- Don't you--
- What's the difference?

04:24.800 --> 04:26.160
I got second place in the exam.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.760
The recruitment is a sure thing.

04:27.840 --> 04:28.720
Yulin.

04:31.800 --> 04:33.680
Did you fry your brain during the exam?

04:33.760 --> 04:36.520
You're just here to work.
Do you really think you're the hostess?

04:37.240 --> 04:38.880
As an outsider,

04:38.960 --> 04:40.600
it's none of your business.

04:52.200 --> 04:53.320
Give it back to me.

04:56.080 --> 04:58.720
Why are you sneaking around here?

05:03.800 --> 05:04.640
Qingchuan.

05:05.440 --> 05:06.280
This…

05:07.800 --> 05:09.720
How dare you steal the stone
from Lord Changheng?

05:09.800 --> 05:11.080
What are you talking about?

05:11.600 --> 05:13.280
Lord Changheng gave it to me personally.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.080
Have you gone out of your mind?

05:15.160 --> 05:16.200
It's fine
that Lord Changheng gave it to me.

05:16.280 --> 05:18.200
He doesn't even know you.
Why does he give you things for no reason?

05:18.280 --> 05:19.480
You knew nothing.

05:19.560 --> 05:22.640
Lord Changheng told me himself that
Firefly Stone is destined to be mine.

05:23.440 --> 05:24.640
- Give it to me!
- You're caught red-handed.

05:24.720 --> 05:25.640
How dare you deny it?

05:25.720 --> 05:27.520
- Qingchuan, bring the lord here.
- Stop arguing, two fairies.

05:27.600 --> 05:28.800
Confront me if you dare.

05:28.880 --> 05:30.200
- Give it back to me!
- Stop arguing.

05:37.920 --> 05:38.760
Just now,

05:39.280 --> 05:41.440
Yulin and I had a quarrel.

05:43.000 --> 05:44.240
It's not a big deal.

05:44.320 --> 05:45.360
Sorry to offend you.

05:46.320 --> 05:48.400
Please forgive me, Lord Yunzhong.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.560
It's about Changheng.

05:52.080 --> 05:53.480
Of course it's a big deal.

05:56.600 --> 05:57.480
Danyin.

05:58.360 --> 06:01.880
You said Yulin
stole the Firefly Stone of Changheng?

06:02.800 --> 06:03.760
Is it true?

06:06.840 --> 06:08.000
Yulin said

06:09.400 --> 06:12.120
this Firefly Stone
was given by Lord Changheng.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.920
Maybe I misunderstood her.

06:17.520 --> 06:18.520
I see.

06:19.520 --> 06:20.800
Is that true, Yulin?

06:21.880 --> 06:24.280
Yes, it was a gift from Lord Changheng.

06:24.760 --> 06:26.560
I didn't steal it.

06:26.640 --> 06:28.160
Please investigate it, Lord Yunzhong.

06:29.440 --> 06:30.400
That's not true.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.040
Lord Yunzhong,

06:48.120 --> 06:50.080
Magical Firefly Stone
is beneficial to cultivation.

06:50.160 --> 06:51.600
I always wear it with me

06:52.680 --> 06:54.080
and never gave it to anyone.

06:58.320 --> 06:59.200
Yulin,

06:59.680 --> 07:02.560
deceiving Lord Yunzhong
is as serious as stealing.

07:02.640 --> 07:03.520
Two crimes shall be punished together.

07:03.600 --> 07:06.200
You'll be dismissed
and demoted to a lower immortal.

07:06.760 --> 07:07.600
Understand?

07:08.200 --> 07:09.120
I…

07:09.200 --> 07:10.200
I didn't lie to you.

07:10.280 --> 07:12.920
I was just afraid that
people would gossip about Lord Changheng.

07:13.000 --> 07:14.680
- That's why--
- Stop talking nonsense.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.280
Lord Yunzhong,

07:18.800 --> 07:20.520
I don't even know Fairy Yulin.

07:21.080 --> 07:24.120
She lied to get away
with the crime of theft.

07:24.200 --> 07:25.360
According to our fair law,

07:25.440 --> 07:28.280
she needs to be removed from her post
and sent to reflect on her mistakes.

07:33.560 --> 07:34.480
Yulin.

07:35.760 --> 07:38.240
Considering your mother
has been doing her job well,

07:38.320 --> 07:41.400
and has always abided by her duties,

07:43.160 --> 07:45.360
I'll give you one last chance.

07:46.280 --> 07:47.520
Did you steal

07:48.400 --> 07:50.080
the Firefly Stone

07:50.600 --> 07:52.600
or Changheng gave it to you?

07:53.880 --> 07:54.720
He gave it to me.

08:04.520 --> 08:05.880
In that case,

08:07.080 --> 08:08.080
take her down.

08:08.880 --> 08:10.240
Remove her immortal bones

08:11.080 --> 08:13.200
and get her out of Shenshui Hall.

08:21.880 --> 08:23.120
- Go.
- I'm innocent.

08:31.400 --> 08:32.320
Lord Yunzhong.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.480
Yulin has done bad deeds
and violated heaven's rules,

08:34.559 --> 08:35.679
but she doesn't deserve this.

08:35.760 --> 08:37.559
Please withdraw your order.

08:38.520 --> 08:40.360
Lord Yunzhong, please spare her this time.

08:41.000 --> 08:43.520
At worst,
forbid her to work at Fountain Palace.

08:44.480 --> 08:46.600
- Father, please help her to beg for mercy.
- Enough.

08:47.760 --> 08:49.200
Since when fairies in Yujing

08:50.040 --> 08:51.600
have no manners at all?

08:55.920 --> 08:57.520
They don't understand.

08:58.040 --> 08:59.000
Neither do you?

09:00.000 --> 09:01.720
As the youngest son of Lord Dong

09:01.800 --> 09:03.440
and the God of War at Shuiyuntian,

09:04.600 --> 09:07.080
you must not make any mistakes.

09:12.680 --> 09:13.960
Have you heard of it?

09:14.040 --> 09:16.520
Yulin seems to have
committed a serious crime.

09:17.640 --> 09:20.680
Her immortal bones will be removed
and she won't be reincarnated forever.

09:20.760 --> 09:21.880
What did she do?

09:21.960 --> 09:23.160
- I don't know.
- I don't know.

09:23.240 --> 09:26.520
I heard several high immortals
pleaded for her but all in vain.

09:26.600 --> 09:28.080
Why did she commit such a big crime?

09:28.880 --> 09:29.720
That's right.

09:29.800 --> 09:31.280
What did she do?

09:31.360 --> 09:32.200
Who knows?

09:32.280 --> 09:33.560
I don't know.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.080
I've never heard of it before.

09:35.160 --> 09:36.120
Yes.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.280
I don't know why.

09:44.800 --> 09:45.680
It's her.

09:45.760 --> 09:47.680
She took the Firefly Stone. It's not me.

09:47.760 --> 09:48.640
- Shut up.
- It's her.

09:48.720 --> 09:49.640
- How dare you frame others as criminals?
- It's her.

09:49.720 --> 09:50.840
- It's not me.
- Go.

09:50.920 --> 09:52.520
- Go.
- It's not me.

09:52.600 --> 09:53.640
How could it be Orchid?

09:53.720 --> 09:54.840
Is she trying to frame her?

10:03.560 --> 10:05.200
It's just a stone.

10:05.280 --> 10:07.600
Your brother is too cruel.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.800
It's not just about the stone.

10:12.440 --> 10:14.440
Yulin saw that things got out of hand

10:14.520 --> 10:16.440
and she didn't want
to be punished for stealing,

10:17.000 --> 10:19.040
so she lied and said
it was a gift from me.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.320
But she didn't know

10:21.000 --> 10:22.080
that if she stole it,

10:22.160 --> 10:23.680
it would be a matter of poor morality.

10:23.760 --> 10:24.880
She could still be forgiven.

10:24.960 --> 10:26.080
But if it was given by me,

10:26.960 --> 10:28.560
it meant she had an affair with me.

10:28.640 --> 10:29.680
She wouldn't be forgiven.

10:29.760 --> 10:31.160
I'm engaged.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.360
I can't fall in love with others.

10:34.640 --> 10:36.800
My brother will never allow me

10:36.880 --> 10:39.480
to harm the dignity of the immortals.

10:39.560 --> 10:40.760
So the punishment to Yulin

10:42.320 --> 10:43.640
is a warning.

10:47.920 --> 10:49.800
There are only a few names on the list.

10:49.880 --> 10:51.400
You've been reading them for two hours.

11:00.400 --> 11:01.880
Is it the owner of the handkerchief

11:02.920 --> 11:04.160
who made you worried?

11:18.400 --> 11:20.760
ORCHID OF ARBITER HALL

11:20.840 --> 11:22.440
FIVE HUNDRED YEARS AGO

11:22.520 --> 11:23.440
Here you go.

11:35.640 --> 11:36.560
You're leaving?

11:40.400 --> 11:42.640
Where am I going to find you?

11:44.440 --> 11:45.400
After I leave,

11:46.920 --> 11:48.000
there's no need to find me.

11:50.760 --> 11:52.360
You'll forget me soon.

11:53.400 --> 11:54.280
No, I won't.

11:54.800 --> 11:57.040
You are my first friend at Shuiyuntian.

11:57.120 --> 11:58.800
I'll never forget you.

12:03.680 --> 12:04.880
Well,

12:04.960 --> 12:06.960
if I want to…

12:55.040 --> 12:56.120
Wait.

13:05.680 --> 13:08.640
You wanted to give it to me?

13:19.760 --> 13:23.080
You'd better remember
my name and background.

13:23.680 --> 13:26.840
Because I'll defeat all of you
in the immortal examination.

14:11.600 --> 14:13.520
She finally passed the exam

14:14.080 --> 14:15.080
and won the first place,

14:15.600 --> 14:17.280
but you eliminated her name.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.280
ORCHID OF ARBITER HALL

14:18.360 --> 14:19.440
She will be sad.

14:33.000 --> 14:35.000
This is the only way I can protect her.

14:39.320 --> 14:41.800
ORCHID OF ARBITER HALL

15:03.560 --> 15:04.520
- Go.
- Are we on the list?

15:04.600 --> 15:06.240
- Let's go and check it.
- Do you see yours?

15:06.320 --> 15:07.240
Is my name on it?

15:08.160 --> 15:10.760
- I'm so excited.
- Great. I'm on the list.

15:10.840 --> 15:12.640
SHUIYUNTIAN LIST OF DUTIES FOR FAIRIES

15:12.720 --> 15:13.800
Is it your name?

15:14.600 --> 15:15.560
Great.

15:15.640 --> 15:16.840
Please help me find mine too.

15:16.920 --> 15:19.000
- Great.
- Let me see if my name is on the list.

15:19.640 --> 15:20.920
I see mine!

15:21.000 --> 15:22.160
- Great!
- Great!

15:23.840 --> 15:24.720
Great!

15:25.200 --> 15:26.120
Great.

15:26.200 --> 15:27.040
Great.

15:28.960 --> 15:29.920
Excuse me.

15:31.160 --> 15:32.720
I saw it. I'm on the list.

15:32.800 --> 15:33.800
It's you.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.560
Great.

15:35.640 --> 15:36.640
- Yes.
- Great!

15:36.720 --> 15:38.120
I guess I failed, didn't I?

15:40.280 --> 15:41.440
I saw it.

15:41.520 --> 15:42.440
Congrats to both of us.

15:42.520 --> 15:44.760
- We must go back and tell her.
- We can work there together.

15:44.840 --> 15:46.600
My cultivation
for all these years is in vain.

15:46.680 --> 15:48.520
SHUIYUNTIAN LIST OF DUTIES FOR FAIRIES

15:48.600 --> 15:50.320
- I'm not on the list again.
- I see my name.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.400
Great.

15:51.480 --> 15:52.320
- Whose?
- Really?

15:52.400 --> 15:53.920
Am I not in the first place?

15:54.000 --> 15:56.080
- That's great.
- Why isn't my name on the list?

15:57.960 --> 15:58.880
Impossible.

15:58.960 --> 16:00.240
It must be a mistake.

16:00.320 --> 16:02.200
I'll ask Aunt Sansheng about it.

16:02.680 --> 16:03.600
Excuse me.

16:04.200 --> 16:05.160
Is your name on it?

16:05.240 --> 16:06.280
I need to work harder.

16:07.120 --> 16:08.360
- Aunt Sansheng--
- No need to ask.

16:08.440 --> 16:10.600
Lord Changheng
eliminated your name himself.

16:11.640 --> 16:12.600
Eliminated my name?

16:15.080 --> 16:16.680
Lord Changheng didn't want to accept you.

16:16.760 --> 16:18.640
We should respect his decision.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.680
Don't worry.

16:20.320 --> 16:21.960
After the ceremony,

16:22.040 --> 16:24.480
I'll find a good job for you.

16:24.560 --> 16:26.200
- Did you see that?
- Yes.

16:27.400 --> 16:28.240
I'm so happy.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.240
Changheng…

16:30.640 --> 16:31.760
Lord Changheng

16:32.600 --> 16:33.960
didn't want to accept me?

16:38.160 --> 16:39.240
I saw it.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.560
We can go together.

16:41.640 --> 16:42.520
It's me.

16:44.680 --> 16:45.560
Great.

16:45.640 --> 16:46.520
Look.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.400
- Great.
- Yes, I'm on the list.

16:49.920 --> 16:50.800
Great.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.800
How could this happen?

17:33.160 --> 17:34.520
How could this happen?

17:35.760 --> 17:38.080
Lord Changheng eliminated me.

17:38.760 --> 17:41.120
But he praised me before.

17:42.720 --> 17:44.720
The Firefly Stone is gone too.

17:45.920 --> 17:46.800
Why?

17:49.080 --> 17:51.400
Daqiang, why?

18:02.480 --> 18:03.640
Follow me.

18:13.480 --> 18:15.800
Orchid of Arbiter Hall
who lured the beast with herself

18:15.880 --> 18:18.280
and saved all the fairies

18:18.360 --> 18:20.160
during the exam.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.640
- Do you remember her?
- Yes.

18:23.800 --> 18:25.680
Of course I do
since she's the first place.

18:25.760 --> 18:27.360
She's the champion.

18:28.120 --> 18:30.320
Why is she refused by Fountain Palace?

18:30.800 --> 18:31.800
You worried too much.

18:34.600 --> 18:37.200
Then why did you only eliminate her?

18:43.080 --> 18:43.960
It's because

18:44.480 --> 18:45.440
she doesn't deserve it.

18:52.120 --> 18:54.840
But I heard you praised her before.

18:55.480 --> 19:00.240
You said she was brave,
intelligent, pure, and kind.

19:01.920 --> 19:03.040
Even so,

19:03.520 --> 19:04.880
she's just an ordinary orchid

19:04.960 --> 19:06.840
in Yunmeng lake.

19:06.920 --> 19:08.920
If it weren't for the fate of Arbiter,

19:09.000 --> 19:11.120
she wouldn't have had
the chance to come to Yujing

19:11.200 --> 19:12.440
and enlighten herself here.

19:12.520 --> 19:13.440
Moreover,

19:13.520 --> 19:14.960
her immortal root has been damaged.

19:15.040 --> 19:17.040
She's not qualified
to practice cultivation.

19:17.600 --> 19:19.200
It's fine if she joins the army to train.

19:19.720 --> 19:21.760
Why would I receive a lowly elf

19:22.280 --> 19:24.160
who is even weaker

19:24.680 --> 19:25.920
than the fairy servant?

19:34.400 --> 19:36.920
Now you know why
Changheng wouldn't take you in, right?

19:39.000 --> 19:39.840
Lord Yunzhong,

19:39.920 --> 19:41.520
don't worry about such trivial matters.

19:41.600 --> 19:42.840
The most important thing now

19:43.520 --> 19:45.000
is to find the evil spirit

19:45.520 --> 19:46.720
and the mastermind.

19:51.600 --> 19:52.600
Go ahead.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.120
There's an immortal criminal
sneaked into Shuiyuntian recently.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.640
The God of War, Changheng,

20:25.720 --> 20:27.720
you're ordered
to investigate it thoroughly now.

20:27.800 --> 20:29.600
If you find anyone suspicious,

20:29.680 --> 20:30.880
kill him immediately.

20:30.960 --> 20:31.840
Yes.

20:58.320 --> 21:00.360
Daqiang, I'm fine.

21:00.440 --> 21:01.680
You don't have to accompany me.

21:01.760 --> 21:03.320
Don't try to lie to me.

21:03.920 --> 21:06.560
I know you want to cry.

21:08.040 --> 21:09.360
Why should I cry?

21:10.600 --> 21:12.120
Fairy Danyin was right.

21:12.680 --> 21:16.200
I, a nameless and weak orchid,

21:16.280 --> 21:17.840
finally passed the exam.

21:18.960 --> 21:21.360
I should have celebrated with fireworks.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.880
What should I cry for?

21:24.480 --> 21:27.400
Right, I'll go to Peach

21:27.480 --> 21:30.240
and let her perform
the scattering flowers.

21:30.720 --> 21:32.040
Don't force yourself to be strong.

21:32.920 --> 21:35.280
I can feel your thoughts and feelings.

21:36.680 --> 21:38.520
You don't have to
bear them in front of me.

21:44.040 --> 21:45.880
In everyone's mind,

21:45.960 --> 21:49.160
I'm just an unknown wild plant.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.880
Those fairies look down on me.

21:52.440 --> 21:55.560
They don't even know I'm an orchid.

21:57.760 --> 22:02.680
I thought only Lord Changheng
considered me the same as them.

22:03.800 --> 22:05.480
You don't know how happy I was

22:06.080 --> 22:09.040
when he praised me.

22:12.000 --> 22:13.680
I knew.

22:13.760 --> 22:15.240
But I didn't expect that

22:16.040 --> 22:18.080
in Lord Changheng's mind,

22:18.160 --> 22:21.240
I'm different from them.

22:21.320 --> 22:23.520
He looks down upon me too.

22:44.360 --> 22:46.920
Changheng is blind.

22:47.680 --> 22:49.080
He doesn't know who's nice to him.

22:51.680 --> 22:53.960
Don't criticize Lord Changheng.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.520
Do you still want to protect him?

22:59.120 --> 23:00.040
Forget it.

23:00.680 --> 23:02.760
You are different from them.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.320
Daqiang.

23:07.240 --> 23:08.960
Do you look down on me?

23:18.800 --> 23:21.200
I said so because

23:22.160 --> 23:23.440
you are much more precious

23:24.520 --> 23:25.720
than them.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.360
Precious?

23:37.480 --> 23:38.640
To me,

23:39.520 --> 23:41.680
you are as precious as my life.

23:45.000 --> 23:47.560
You've said that many times.

23:49.120 --> 23:51.240
I'm going to take it seriously
if you keep saying that.

23:56.240 --> 23:57.080
No.

23:57.600 --> 23:58.760
I don't believe it.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.720
Do you dare to question me?

24:04.560 --> 24:05.520
Forget it.

24:05.600 --> 24:07.120
It's okay if you don't believe me,

24:07.920 --> 24:09.000
but don't cry.

24:09.800 --> 24:10.640
If you cry,

24:11.640 --> 24:12.920
I'll feel sad too.

24:42.880 --> 24:46.200
ARBITER HALL

24:47.840 --> 24:49.040
Is anyone in the palace?

24:49.120 --> 24:50.600
We are ordered to search here.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.680
Is anyone in the palace?

25:00.760 --> 25:02.320
We are ordered to search here.

25:05.000 --> 25:05.960
Let's enter the palace.

25:22.160 --> 25:23.560
Daqiang, no!

26:36.880 --> 26:38.160
Don't disturb plants.

26:38.240 --> 26:39.640
And don't destroy anything.

26:40.120 --> 26:41.000
Yes.

28:40.480 --> 28:46.280
ARBITER HALL

28:46.360 --> 28:50.920
ARBITER HALL

29:07.400 --> 29:09.840
I was just afraid that
you would suffocate to death, so…

29:09.920 --> 29:11.680
I understand.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.680
I didn't push you away just now.

29:13.760 --> 29:15.080
because I was afraid that…

29:15.640 --> 29:18.120
I was afraid that…

29:19.720 --> 29:20.880
I'll go get changed first.

29:58.280 --> 30:02.120
DONGFANG QINGCANG'S SEA OF EMOTIONS

31:19.040 --> 31:20.640
My chest is so stuffy.

31:23.560 --> 31:24.720
What's wrong with her again?

31:28.200 --> 31:29.080
Shangque.

31:31.320 --> 31:32.240
Yes.

31:33.440 --> 31:35.320
Have you found the Heart-Hiding Hairpin

31:35.400 --> 31:36.480
that I asked you to find?

31:37.320 --> 31:38.240
Please forgive me.

31:38.800 --> 31:42.240
The Heart-Hiding Hairpin has disappeared
since the civil unrest of the Moon Tribe.

31:42.320 --> 31:43.200
Until now,

31:44.360 --> 31:45.480
it has never appeared.

31:46.160 --> 31:48.040
Without the Heart-Hiding Hairpin,

31:48.120 --> 31:51.200
how long do I have to bear
with her changeable thoughts?

31:51.280 --> 31:52.920
I have a lot on my plate.

31:53.000 --> 31:54.920
How can I be disturbed
by her all the time?

31:56.000 --> 31:57.040
My lord, please forgive me.

31:58.520 --> 31:59.440
Forget it.

32:00.560 --> 32:02.320
When I return to Cangyan Sea

32:02.400 --> 32:04.320
and retrieve the holy token
of the Moon Supreme,

32:04.400 --> 32:06.320
I can also block these distractions.

32:08.960 --> 32:11.040
But I've tried so hard,

32:11.120 --> 32:13.640
why does Little Flower Spirit
only recover 90%?

32:14.280 --> 32:15.800
Why can't she be fully healed?

32:18.280 --> 32:19.160
My lord,

32:20.160 --> 32:21.000
I think

32:21.080 --> 32:23.760
Little Flower Spirit always wanted
to serve Changheng by his side

32:23.840 --> 32:24.720
but failed to make it.

32:25.440 --> 32:26.280
I think

32:26.880 --> 32:28.680
that 10% of unrecoverable magical power

32:28.760 --> 32:30.120
has caused her mental illness.

32:30.800 --> 32:34.160
I think this mental illness
must be related to Changheng.

32:37.960 --> 32:41.000
What's so good about Changheng?

32:42.400 --> 32:44.840
Why is she so fond of him?

32:49.280 --> 32:50.160
Orchid.

32:52.040 --> 32:53.040
Fairy Danyin.

32:54.920 --> 32:56.120
It's dangerous now, you know?

32:56.200 --> 32:57.120
Your power is so weak.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.800
How dare you wander around alone?

33:00.400 --> 33:02.640
Don't you know the soldiers
are searching everywhere?

33:02.720 --> 33:04.640
Are they still looking
for the immortal criminal?

33:04.720 --> 33:05.720
Not an immortal criminal.

33:05.800 --> 33:07.160
It's the Moon Tribe.

33:08.400 --> 33:09.240
The Moon Tribe?

33:09.840 --> 33:10.680
Yes.

33:10.760 --> 33:12.720
Someone from the Moon Tribe
has sneaked into Yujing.

33:12.800 --> 33:13.920
No one knows where he hides.

33:14.800 --> 33:17.520
Logically, Shuiyuntian
is strictly guarded.

33:18.400 --> 33:20.080
How could the Moon Tribe get in?

33:21.400 --> 33:23.720
Could it be that
someone of the Moon Tribe escaped

33:24.720 --> 33:26.120
from Haotian Tower?

33:27.800 --> 33:30.640
Isn't an immortal criminal
in Haotian Tower?

33:33.600 --> 33:35.200
My father told me that

33:35.800 --> 33:37.120
except for immortal criminals,

33:37.200 --> 33:38.840
there are also the ones of the Moon Tribe.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.400
The Moon Tribe?

33:57.160 --> 33:59.280
Daqiang, you're here.

33:59.360 --> 34:00.200
Please have a seat.

34:03.480 --> 34:05.160
It's not easy for me to pass the exam,

34:05.240 --> 34:07.000
so we should celebrate it.

34:07.080 --> 34:08.600
Let me offer you a drink.

34:08.679 --> 34:09.520
Come here.

34:23.719 --> 34:25.639
This is the immortal liquor my master hid.

34:25.719 --> 34:26.719
Have a taste.

34:32.760 --> 34:33.600
Let me ask you.

34:34.199 --> 34:37.159
What is the tree hole
on the tree of Destiny Books?

34:38.639 --> 34:41.199
Didn't you hear my answer
on the day when Danyin came?

34:41.280 --> 34:42.320
That's not a tree hole.

34:42.400 --> 34:43.600
It's Tianji Mirror.

34:43.679 --> 34:45.159
It can predict the future.

34:45.239 --> 34:47.199
Predicting the future?

34:48.440 --> 34:49.320
Is it accurate?

34:50.679 --> 34:52.320
Why do you all ask about this?

34:52.400 --> 34:54.000
Just answer my question.

34:55.280 --> 34:56.199
It's accurate.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.320
Nothing went wrong before.

34:59.440 --> 35:01.160
Why did I ask about this?

35:01.720 --> 35:05.640
What does it have to do with me
whether she can marry Changheng or not?

35:06.280 --> 35:07.200
No.

35:07.760 --> 35:10.960
What I truly cared about
was not the wedding but the spell.

35:11.600 --> 35:12.800
If this spell can't be broken,

35:13.360 --> 35:15.240
I can't allow her to marry Changheng.

35:15.800 --> 35:16.720
Otherwise,

35:16.800 --> 35:19.400
Shuiyuntian will control my weakness.

35:24.240 --> 35:25.600
Daqiang, a toast to you.

35:26.120 --> 35:27.040
The first cup.

35:27.520 --> 35:29.760
Thank you for saving my life
so many times.

35:33.960 --> 35:34.840
Cheers.

35:47.120 --> 35:48.200
It's really fine liquor.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.760
Drink it then.

35:53.720 --> 35:54.640
I mean,

35:55.240 --> 35:56.160
since it's fine liquor,

35:56.240 --> 35:57.200
you should drink more.

35:57.280 --> 35:59.120
Look, I've finished mine.

36:18.040 --> 36:19.200
The second cup.

36:19.280 --> 36:22.560
Thank you for the morning dew
and flower soup you got for me.

36:36.400 --> 36:39.200
OBLIVION RIVER

36:48.320 --> 36:49.680
Little Flower Spirit.

36:51.800 --> 36:52.720
You're awake.

36:56.200 --> 36:57.760
These are your favorite flower cakes.

36:57.840 --> 36:59.560
You can take them with you
on your way back.

37:00.760 --> 37:01.960
And this blanket.

37:02.040 --> 37:03.560
I'm afraid you'll feel cold at night

37:03.640 --> 37:05.000
when you pass this mountain.

37:05.080 --> 37:06.000
By the way,

37:06.080 --> 37:08.800
you said you liked my master's liquor,

37:08.880 --> 37:10.200
I also took it for you.

37:11.200 --> 37:12.840
What do you want indeed?

37:15.400 --> 37:16.400
To see you off.

37:19.400 --> 37:21.200
Actually, I'm not that stupid.

37:21.800 --> 37:23.320
I knew

37:23.400 --> 37:25.040
you are not an immortal criminal,

37:25.120 --> 37:25.960
but the Moon Tribe.

37:37.200 --> 37:38.400
But these days,

37:38.480 --> 37:41.760
I feel very happy
when you are by my side at Arbiter Hall.

37:41.840 --> 37:43.160
I'm not lonely at all.

37:43.240 --> 37:45.720
It has been a long time
since someone accompanied me like this.

37:45.800 --> 37:47.760
People in the Fairy Realm say

37:47.840 --> 37:49.920
that the Moon Tribe is full of bad people.

37:50.000 --> 37:51.800
But after I met you,

37:51.880 --> 37:53.760
I think you're not bad at all.

37:53.840 --> 37:56.800
Not everyone
in the Moon Tribe is bad, right?

38:00.400 --> 38:01.320
I know

38:01.400 --> 38:02.800
you don't want to leave,

38:02.880 --> 38:04.200
but it's different now.

38:04.280 --> 38:06.280
Now, Shuiyuntian
is in the midst of danger.

38:06.360 --> 38:08.400
Once your identity
as a Moon Tribe is discovered,

38:08.480 --> 38:09.880
you'll die for sure.

38:10.640 --> 38:12.280
So you drugged me and made me unconscious?

38:13.440 --> 38:15.120
If you were obedient,

38:15.200 --> 38:17.280
I wouldn't have done that.

38:17.840 --> 38:19.040
Have you ever considered

38:19.680 --> 38:21.360
what would happen

38:21.440 --> 38:22.800
if what you did was found by others?

38:25.280 --> 38:27.160
If you're found to collude
with the Moon Tribe,

38:27.240 --> 38:28.400
you'll be imprisoned at least

38:28.480 --> 38:29.440
or be killed directly.

38:30.000 --> 38:32.760
I told you before
that emotion is just a burden.

38:33.680 --> 38:35.800
Your kindness makes you stupid.

38:36.480 --> 38:38.000
If you want to be safe,

38:38.640 --> 38:41.040
you should hand me over.

38:43.200 --> 38:45.520
You have a point.

38:47.200 --> 38:48.160
But if it weren't you,

38:48.720 --> 38:51.000
I would have died in Haishi.

38:51.080 --> 38:53.600
Speaking of which,
I've already lived much longer.

38:58.600 --> 39:01.200
After the effects of the drug
have worn off, just run away.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.560
Get out of Shuiyuntian.

39:02.640 --> 39:03.840
Don't ever come back again.

39:04.480 --> 39:07.600
You and I will never meet again.

39:13.800 --> 39:14.760
I…

39:15.600 --> 39:16.720
I'll miss you too.

39:38.960 --> 39:40.000
Daqiang.

39:42.120 --> 39:43.080
Bye.

40:30.240 --> 40:31.640
So emotions aren't a burden.

40:31.720 --> 40:33.880
It's the reason we survived this time.

40:33.960 --> 40:35.320
Love

40:36.200 --> 40:37.120
and hate.

40:37.600 --> 40:40.840
These will be your obstacles
when you make decisions.

40:42.120 --> 40:45.160
If you are not merciful,

40:45.240 --> 40:50.240
you'll become the strongest one
in the three realms.

41:11.800 --> 41:15.480
FOUNTAIN PALACE

41:20.040 --> 41:20.960
Eliminated my name?

41:21.040 --> 41:22.800
Lord Changheng didn't want to accept you.

41:24.000 --> 41:25.400
- I'm so excited.
- Great.

41:25.480 --> 41:26.320
Yes.

41:26.400 --> 41:27.920
- You're on the list too.
- So is Baicui.

41:28.560 --> 41:29.760
Great! I'm on the list.

41:30.800 --> 41:31.800
I'm in.

41:40.040 --> 41:42.520
My lord, we've made some progress
investigating the evil spirit.
